<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hi {{name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We received a request to reset the password of your {{appName}} account. Choose a new password with the button below.</p>
{{> button url=resetUrl label="Reset password"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The link works for {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes and only once. If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;word-break:break-all;"><a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color:#4F46E5;">{{resetUrl}}</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5B6478;">If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email: your password stays the same.</p>
